## Usage

```rust
use termrock::widgets::{Chip, ChipState, TokenStrip, TokenItem, TokenStripState};

let chip = Chip::new("rust", "rust", &system).removable(true);
let mut state = ChipState::new(false);
state.set_focused(true);
// Space toggles selection; Delete removes when removable

let items = [
    TokenItem::chip("a", "rust").selected(true),
    TokenItem::tag("b", "file.rs").removable(true),
];
let strip = TokenStrip::new(&items, &system).wrap().max_visible(6);
```

## vs Tag / Badge

| | Chip | Tag | Badge |
|--|------|-----|-------|
| Select | yes | no | optional |
| Remove | optional | optional | no |
| Use | filters | attachments | status labels |

